# MDC Rule Management

- All new MDC rules MUST be created within the `.agents/rules/` directory.
- Each rule MUST be a separate markdown file with the `.mdc` extension.
- Rules MUST follow the frontmatter format:
  ```yaml
  ---
  description: Brief description of the rule's purpose.
  globs: Pattern of files this rule applies to (e.g., "**/*.kt", "src/**/*.rs").
  ---
  ```
- Use descriptive filenames prefixed with the rule's primary concern (e.g., `kotlin-style.mdc`, `rust-safety.mdc`).
